      "name": "礼物图文",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Birthday Gift:",
        "title": "Honor the Amazing Woman She’s Grown to Be",
        "text": "<p>Pair the stylish and intelligent FANY Luna smartwatch with our radiant 14K gold-plated butterfly bracelet—a meaningful gift designed to make every birthday celebration even more unforgettable.<br/>（Please note: The set does not include a decorative gift box. ）</p>",
