        "eyebrow": "Anniversary Gift:",
        "title": "Together, We Shine",
        "text": "<p>The best kind of love is growing through every chapter of life together. Paired with our 14K gold-plated butterfly bracelet, FANY Luna celebrates the journey you've shared and all the beautiful moments still to come.</p>",
